### Simple evaluation (plain text)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/resume/evaluate/simple
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "resumeText": "Software developer with 3 years of experience in Java, Spring Boot, and REST APIs. Built and maintained backend services for an e-commerce platform. Familiar with SQL, Git, and Agile methodologies. Currently learning React and cloud basics.",
  "jobDescriptionText": "We are looking for a Backend Developer with strong Java and Spring Boot skills, experience with SQL databases, and familiarity with cloud platforms (AWS or Azure). Experience with Docker and CI/CD pipelines is a plus. Must be comfortable working in an Agile team."
}


